From 271e6144be35692ff34738357deb52496e355142 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Head of Security <security@buildwithaai.invalid>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:55:20 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Check the chunk chain tail on every append and let the freeze
 lift (L-14, L-16)

- appendChunkEdit re-hashes the last row before linking to it. A mismatch rolls back,
  freezes chunk writes, and refuses with CHAIN.
- restoreChunkChain lifts chunk_chain_broken once verify passes: at boot, or from a new
  owner desk button. Creative and territory flags stay as the owner left them.
